  "title": "Enable Actor Switching with the Left and Right Cursor Keys [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "アクター切替をカーソルの左右で可能に【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "4d158cf92b8c3ea96825353c6dee738096b9ac831b838283ef15c6c2f3bab5f3",
      "translation": "Enable Actor Switching with the Left and Right Cursor Keys [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "4d158cf92b8c3ea96825353c6dee738096b9ac831b838283ef15c6c2f3bab5f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常はPageup, Pagedownで行う各種画面でのアクター切替機能をカーソルの左右で行えるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "959e86e1f0eebf806d1f3e17a309405538518ebff7a74711fcb6dc886f9e1085",
      "translation": "This allows you to switch actors in various screens using the left and right cursor keys, instead of the usual Pageup and Pagedown keys.",
      "contextHash": "959e86e1f0eebf806d1f3e17a309405538518ebff7a74711fcb6dc886f9e1085"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save the file, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Enable the feature through RPG Maker's Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
