    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象となるウィンドウ名を設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "fc61b909f46dd22f60bf85ab3cab5a94f71d9ab6d9023b36ccb4f7b6b7ee4745",
      "translation": "Set the names of the target windows.",
      "contextHash": "fc61b909f46dd22f60bf85ab3cab5a94f71d9ab6d9023b36ccb4f7b6b7ee4745"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、初期状態から以下のウィンドウを登録しています。",
      "sourceHash": "a7516c3761a9ad83462a6b29397e02d3d4c1f408d40962b94fab90ee498c468f",
      "translation": "The following windows are registered by default.",
      "contextHash": "a7516c3761a9ad83462a6b29397e02d3d4c1f408d40962b94fab90ee498c468f"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "Window_SkillType : スキル画面",
      "sourceHash": "1b6d0255bcdb6dbe926716c72568614e8328ad76ff913ccff6832a0f21eb59af",
      "translation": "Window_SkillType: Skill screen",
      "contextHash": "1b6d0255bcdb6dbe926716c72568614e8328ad76ff913ccff6832a0f21eb59af"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "Window_Status : ステータス画面",
      "sourceHash": "b352cc3e470d3c9991a4cb8c331b3ca60ce14f26131e5e1d3f1992e710bf7093",
      "translation": "Window_Status: Status screen",
      "contextHash": "b352cc3e470d3c9991a4cb8c331b3ca60ce14f26131e5e1d3f1992e710bf7093"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "◆以下は通常は不要ですが、他プラグインとの併用を想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "8b320a935d28c113a4ac1f262abc69b9f94076e6a767817d158e9f0674fdef6d",
      "translation": "◆The following is normally unnecessary, but is provided for use with other plugins.",
      "contextHash": "8b320a935d28c113a4ac1f262abc69b9f94076e6a767817d158e9f0674fdef6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "外部プラグインによるウィンドウでも、カーソルの左右を使わず、かつPageup, Pagedownで切替できるならば、対象にできる可能性があります。",
      "sourceHash": "a1f0caccd9ecdfe14b96aa977a1fdf68dadc2e16adc43cb9cce0e262b8cb2d32",
      "translation": "Windows provided by external plugins may also be supported if they do not use the left and right cursor keys and can be switched with Pageup and Pagedown.",
      "contextHash": "a1f0caccd9ecdfe14b96aa977a1fdf68dadc2e16adc43cb9cce0e262b8cb2d32"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "逆に言うと装備のコマンド欄（装備～全て外す）のように左右の移動が必要なら、機能が競合してしまうので対応できません。",
      "sourceHash": "2108dd995299159f669f2544c001fbd82d36d9117ade4ef5efe298cd282ec382",
      "translation": "Conversely, if left and right movement is required, as in the equipment command window (Equip through Remove All), the functions will conflict and it cannot be supported.",
      "contextHash": "2108dd995299159f669f2544c001fbd82d36d9117ade4ef5efe298cd282ec382"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※NRP_CustomOptimize.jsの機能を使えば、コマンド欄以外での対応は可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "a430d58cb65880069e279f43dd282881653904a389886138d36379e357d05e66",
      "translation": "※Using the features of NRP_CustomOptimize.js makes support possible outside command windows.",
      "contextHash": "a430d58cb65880069e279f43dd282881653904a389886138d36379e357d05e66"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ウィンドウ名を調べたい場合は「Window_」でプラグイン内を検索して、それっぽい名称を見つけてください。",
      "sourceHash": "d167bc5489349b2831d7e00a06568f500d1f64cf6ef0685004e634eeb05488f1",
      "translation": "If you want to find a window name, search the plugin for “Window_” and look for a likely name.",
      "contextHash": "d167bc5489349b2831d7e00a06568f500d1f64cf6ef0685004e634eeb05488f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "対象ウィンドウ名（TargetWindows）",
      "sourceHash": "459062744a1a0e1bf3828e5298aba1de7ddcac4a82a75414aececfc4d004d2c0",
      "translation": "Target Window Names (TargetWindows)",
      "contextHash": "459062744a1a0e1bf3828e5298aba1de7ddcac4a82a75414aececfc4d004d2c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象とするウィンドウ名です。",
      "sourceHash": "22413c4114a2e14d47016c0ee52778a43e85a4a3150696673eb0a4a2e96a5629",
      "translation": "The names of the target windows.",
      "contextHash": "22413c4114a2e14d47016c0ee52778a43e85a4a3150696673eb0a4a2e96a5629"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "連続切替を許可（AllowRepeat）",
      "sourceHash": "99e47870ddf5e249e876880811119e4fdc92352a86bcaf6793afe10be7c12c2f",
      "translation": "Allow Continuous Switching (AllowRepeat)",
      "contextHash": "99e47870ddf5e249e876880811119e4fdc92352a86bcaf6793afe10be7c12c2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "カーソルキー押しっぱなしによる連続切替を許可します。",
      "sourceHash": "adfada32d67cd6d7b519c0edf9018b1a386f67c8db0aa72f73fa6975985fff6b",
      "translation": "Allows continuous switching when a cursor key is held down.",
      "contextHash": "adfada32d67cd6d7b519c0edf9018b1a386f67c8db0aa72f73fa6975985fff6b"
    }
  ],
